/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413413 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186413404 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413413 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7133b6f3-994d-586b-8bc7-52facdb8edd3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186413397 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186413398 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186413399 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186413401 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186413407 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186413398 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413414 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "76914fbd-7e46-5e1e-a2ea-82b62a7c5f3c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186413414 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1069 "q-143574" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $X$ and $Y$ be two continuous random variables with the following joint probability density function:\n\n$$\nf(x,y)={\\begin{aligned}8xy, & \\,0\\le x\\le y,\\,0\\le y\\le 1 \\\\ 0, & \\,\\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFind $P(\\frac{1}{4}<X<\\frac{1}{2}\\,|\\,Y=\\frac{2}{3}).$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "6fd86b7a-aa64-5ea3-a90b-7af5da2353f8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413415 #edb/ref 1074 "Recall that \n\n$$\nP(Y\\in A\\,|\\,X=x)={\\int }_{A}{f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y)\\,\\text{d}y,\n$$\n\nwhere ${f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ is the conditional probability density function of $X$ given $Y=y.$ \n\nUsing the formula for the marginal density function for $Y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{Y}(y) & ={\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }f(x,y)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{y}8xy\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8y{\\int }_{0}^{y}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =8y{[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{y} \\\\  & =4y({y}^{2}-0) \\\\  & =4{y}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the full expression for ${f}_{Y}(y)$ is the following:\n\n$$\n{f}_{Y}(y)={\\begin{aligned}4{y}^{3}, & \\,0\\le y\\le 1 \\\\ 0, & \\,\\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow recall that the conditional probability density function of $X$ given $Y=y$ for two continuous random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given by\n\n$$\n{f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y)=\\frac{f(x,y)}{{f}_{Y}(y)}.\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n- $f(x,y)$ is the joint probability density function for $X$ and $Y,$ and\n\n- ${f}_{Y}(y)$ is the marginal density function for $Y.$\n\nNow, for $0\\le x\\le 1,0\\le y\\le x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y) & =\\frac{f(x,y)}{{f}_{Y}(y)} \\\\  & =\\frac{8xy}{4{y}^{3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{2x}{{y}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor other values of $x$ and $y,$ the function $f(x,y)$ equals $0.$ As a result, ${f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ will be equal to $0$ too.\n\nTherefore, the conditional probability density function is the following:\n\n$$\n{f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2x}{{y}^{2}}, & \\,0\\le x\\le y,\\,0\\le y\\le 1 \\\\ 0, & \\,\\text{otherwise}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute our probability:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(\\frac{1}{4}<X<\\frac{1}{2}\\,|\\,Y=\\frac{2}{3}) & ={\\int }_{1/4}^{1/2}{f}_{X\\,|\\,Y}(x\\,|\\,y=\\frac{2}{3})\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1/4}^{1/2}\\frac{2x}{{(\\frac{2}{3})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}{\\int }_{1/4}^{1/2}2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}{[{x}^{2}]}_{1/4}^{1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}(\\frac{1}{4}-\\frac{1}{16}) \\\\  & =\\frac{9}{4}(\\frac{3}{16}) \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{64}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413416 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186413417 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413416 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9476e3d9-7d05-54ea-ba2e-44132f1512b5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413416 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186413415 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413417 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "a4e2ce8c-ef99-5939-91ca-5637d283ed7e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413417 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162396 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413418 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186413416 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413418 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "cd604f93-e377-5bb5-97aa-db0cfd4f422a" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186413418 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186162392 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
